---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Biology's Big Questions">
  <main class="big-questions-page">
    <section class="big-questions-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">APS Framework</p>
      <h1>Biology's Big Questions</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Biology is full of deep questions. What is life? What makes something alive?
        Why do organisms appear goal-directed? What are genes, species, evolution,
        and cognition? APS approaches these questions through agency, process, and scale.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="big-questions-introduction">
      <p>
        This page gathers the major public-facing questions addressed by the APS Framework.
        It is designed as a guided entry point rather than an alphabetical article index.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>